     both kept.

The merge also exposed one real defect, fixed (not worked around):
- `src/graph/runGraph.ts`: manus-parity made the `AgentEvent` switch exhaustive, so
  D17's `environment_issue` event hit the `default` arm and tsc failed with
  "Type '...environment_issue...' is not assignable to type 'never'". It is now
  mapped to a finished `note` node (the report is terminal: the agent records it and
  continues rather than asking the user), and a new case in
  `src/graph/__tests__/runGraph.test.ts` covers it. D17 shipped before the exhaustive
  switch existed on parity, so this was a merge-time interaction, not a pre-existing
  failure.

